@startuml candidate_generation
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title Versioned bounded recipient candidate enumeration
component "Validated recipient observation\nno simulator or stale-memory occupancy" as OBS <<app>>
component "Finite per-prefix action families\nround-robin generators; no retention quotas" as PRIMITIVE <<app>>
component "Known append + resource + own-dependency checks" as CHECK <<app>>
component "Depth-cyclic FIFO prefix expansion\n4096 attempted extensions maximum" as SEARCH <<app>>
component "chess-coach.enumeration.v1\npass first; <=512 unique candidates; <=4 actions" as BATCH <<app>>
component "Versioned encoder + Burn scorer" as POLICY <<app>>
OBS --> PRIMITIVE
OBS --> CHECK
PRIMITIVE --> SEARCH
SEARCH --> CHECK : each extension
CHECK --> BATCH : accepted unique prefix
BATCH --> SEARCH : continue bounded prefixes
BATCH --> POLICY
note bottom of BATCH
  Explicitly replaces legacy family quotas and traversal.
  Local eligibility does not guarantee resolution success.
  Algorithm bounds do not grant production admission.
end note
@enduml
